# Active contact flow requires no Cloudflare database secrets.
# /api/contact proxies to the Supabase Edge Function: yalcinmutlu-contact
# Contact messages are stored in:
# public.yalcinmutlu_contact_messages
#
# Supabase database credentials stay inside the Supabase Edge Function runtime.
# EmailJS remains only as a fallback dependency and is not used by the active form.
